**Version**: 1.0
**Status**: Draft — first pass to unblock the build. The service is the superset authority in LOGICAL identity only; no slot ever appears in it. Push origination carries uuid, entry_count, the role table, and ordered logical entries, with no hash. Station and editor are two processes over a UI-to-service API (ruled), and enroll orchestration uploads the captured template to the superset keyed by (person, ordinal). Total-delete retention is ruled; the inactivity clock and the readback-station requirement are proposed for the architect.
